{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Vegetable is the category used for many of the ",["l","农作物","Crops"]," grown on the farm. One ",["l","采集","foraged"]," item, ",["l","蕨菜","Fiddlehead Fern"],", is also considered to be a vegetable. Other foraged items that are real-life vegetables (e.g., ",["l","韭葱","Leek"],"s, ",["l","大葱","Spring Onion"],"s) are categorized as ",["l","采集#Foraged Items","Forage"]," instead of Vegetable and therefore are not included here."]],["p",["All vegetables share several in-game characteristics."]],["l",0,[[1,["Their sell prices are increased by 10% if the player has the ",["l","技能#Farming","Tiller"]," profession."]],[1,["They can be placed in a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"]," to make ",["l","果酱和腌菜","Pickles"],"."]],[1,["They can be placed in a ",["l","小桶","Keg"],". In most cases, the product is ",["l","果汁","Juice"],", except: ",["l","小麦","Wheat"]," produces ",["l","啤酒","Beer"],", ",["l","啤酒花","Hops"]," produce ",["l","淡啤酒","Pale Ale"]," and ",["l","茶叶","Tea Leaves"]," produce ",["l","绿茶","Green Tea"],"."]],[1,["Vegetables (other than ",["l","啤酒花","Hops"],", ",["l","茶叶","Tea Leaves"],", ",["l","未碾米","Unmilled Rice"],", and ",["l","小麦","Wheat"],") are a ",["l","友谊#Universal Likes","universally liked gift"],"; all villagers other than ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", and ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]," like them. There are various individual exceptions, however, as detailed at ",["l","友谊#Universal Likes exceptions","Universal Likes exceptions"],", and on the individual vegetable and villager pages."]],[1,["Vegetables are one category used when scoring items in the ",["l","星露谷展览会#Grange Display","Grange Display"]," at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"],"."]],[1,["They can be sold at the ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","General Store"]," (as well as in the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"],")."]],[1,["All shipped vegetables are added to the ",["l","收集品#Items Shipped","Items Shipped"]," page of the Collections tab."]]]],["p",["The following tables lists all vegetables, where to obtain them, how much they sell for, and the prices of the artisan goods produced using a ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"]," or ",["l","小桶","Keg"],"."]],["t",[[{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Source"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Season"]},{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Artisan Sell Price"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Base"]},{"h":1,"v":[["f","Tiller.png",24]," ",["l","技能#Farming","Tiller"]," (+10%)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Base"]},{"h":1,"v":[["f","Artisan.png",24]," ",["l","技能#Farming","Artisan"]," (+40%)"]}],[[["f","Amaranth.png",48]],[["l","苋菜","Amaranth"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Fall"],["Energy 50\nHealth 22"],["150g"],["150g"],["150g150g"],["150g150g"]],[[["f","Artichoke.png",48]],[["l","洋蓟","Artichoke"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Fall"],["Energy 30\nHealth 13"],["160g"],["160g"],["160g160g"],["160g160g"]],[[["f","Beet.png",48]],[["l","甜菜","Beet"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Fall"],["Energy 30\nHealth 13"],["100g"],["100g"],["100g100g"],["100g100g"]],[[["f","Bok_Choy.png",48]],[["l","小白菜","Bok Choy"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Fall"],["Energy 25\nHealth 11"],["80g"],["80g"],["80g80g"],["80g80g"]],[[["f","Broccoli.png",48]],[["l","西蓝花","Broccoli"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Fall"],["Energy 63\nHealth 28"],["70g"],["70g"],["70g70g"],["70g70g"]],[[["f","Carrot.png",48]],[["l","胡萝卜","Carrot"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Spring"],["Energy 75\nHealth 33"],["35g"],["35g"],["35g35g"],["35g35g"]],[[["f","Cauliflower.png",48]],[["l","花椰菜","Cauliflower"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Spring"],["Energy 75\nHealth 33"],["175g"],["175g"],["175g175g"],["175g175g"]],[[["f","Corn.png",48]],[["l","玉米","Corn"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Summer\nFall"],["Energy 25\nHealth 11"],["50g"],["50g"],["50g50g100g"],["50g50g100g"]],[[["f","Eggplant.png",48]],[["l","茄子","Eggplant"]],[["l","耕种","Farming"]],["Fall"],["Energy 20\nHealth 9"],["60g"],["60g"],["60g60g"],["60g60